@startuml
title UC3 - Issue Referral (Failure Scenario)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Healthcare Professional" as HP
participant "Appointment Tracking System" as System

HP -> System: searchPatient(searchCriteria)
System --> HP: patientInformation

HP -> System: issueReferral(\npatientID, referringProfessionalID,\nrequestedSpecialtyID, requestedProfessionalID,\nclinicalReason, priority)

System --> HP: referralRejected,\nmissingRequiredInformation

note right of System
  Neither a requested specialty
  nor a requested healthcare
  professional was specified.

  No Referral instance
  is created.
end note

@enduml
